<title>USA: Heartstream files patent suit.</title>
<headline>Heartstream files patent suit.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Heartstream Inc said it filed a patent infringement lawsuit against Physio-Control Corp, which alleges Physio-Control is infringing its automatic external defibrillator patent.</p>
<p>Separately, Heartstream said it received a new patent from the U.S. Patent and Trademark Office relating to the company's ForeRunner Automatic External Defibrillator.</p>
<p>(( -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
